[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27841.67, "timestamp": "07:44:01", "text": "一根內存條。然後我把遊戲放進去，結果發現遊戲電腦上的 216 號遊戲機運作不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27848.15, "timestamp": "07:44:08", "text": "你必須停止。  這樣行得通嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27849.91, "timestamp": "07:44:09", "text": "？  呃，沒有CPU，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27866.23, "timestamp": "07:44:26", "text": "這就是問題所在。我遇到問題了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27871.35, "timestamp": "07:44:31", "text": "不，是三。我只有三根記憶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27877.11, "timestamp": "07:44:37", "text": "體。  是的。"}]